  "headExtra": "<title>Freehold Plots for Sale in Greater Noida | Growperty.com</title>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.growperty.com/freehold-plots-greater-noida\" data-react-helmet=\"true\">\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Explore freehold residential plots for sale in Greater Noida's GNIDA-planned sectors. Verify tenure, check prices &amp; request a site visit on Growperty.com.\" data-react-helmet=\"true\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Freehold Plots for Sale in Greater Noida | Growperty.com\" data-react-helmet=\"true\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Explore freehold residential plots for sale in Greater Noida's GNIDA-planned sectors. Verify tenure, check prices &amp; request a site visit on Growperty.com.\" data-react-helmet=\"true\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.growperty.com/growperty-logo.png\" data-react-helmet=\"true\">\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.growperty.com/freehold-plots-greater-noida\" data-react-helmet=\"true\">\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" data-react-helmet=\"true\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\" data-react-helmet=\"true\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What does \\\"freehold\\\" mean for a plot in Greater Noida?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"A freehold plot means the buyer gets full, permanent ownership of the land with no restrictions from the development authority, unlike leasehold land where the authority retains ultimate title. Most GNIDA-allotted residential plots convert to freehold once dues and conversion charges are cleared.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do I verify if a plot is actually freehold?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Always check the seller's original allotment letter, freehold conversion certificate, and registry documents, and independently confirm the status with GNIDA before paying any token amount. We strongly recommend involving a property lawyer.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the typical price range for plots in Greater Noida?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Prices generally range from ₹60,000 to ₹1,20,000 per square yard depending on sector, plot size, road width and corner/park-facing status.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can Growperty help with construction after I buy a plot?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Growperty focuses on property discovery and transactions; for construction, our team can connect you with local architects and contractors on request.\"}}]}</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\" data-react-helmet=\"true\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://www.growperty.com/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Freehold Plots for Sale in Greater Noida\",\"item\":\"https://www.growperty.com/freehold-plots-greater-noida\"}]}</script>",
